## Community Free (this package)

You may **use, install, study, and modify** this package in your own
Laravel / Filament projects — including commercial projects — **without
a fee**, for the Community feature set described in the README and product
docs on https://voodflow.com.

This is **source-available and free to use**. It is **not** an OSI-approved
open-source licence (for example it is not MIT/Apache). In particular you
may **not**, without a separate written agreement from Voodflow:

- redistribute this package (or a substantial modified fork) as a competing
  product, SaaS, or “drop-in” page-builder package under another brand;
- remove or obscure Voodflow / VoodBuilder trademarks, notices, or attribution
  in a way that presents the software as your own product offering;
- claim that paid companion features are included when they are not.

Contributions submitted to the public repository are accepted only under
these same terms (inbound = outbound), unless otherwise agreed in writing.

## Paid companions & editions

Professional / Agency capabilities and companion packages (for example
Elements, Components, Dynamic Data, Templates, VoodPopups, and other
add-ons) are licensed separately under commercial terms via Voodflow /
Anystack. A Community install does **not** grant those rights.

Bundled free dependencies such as `voodflow/vmedia` and `voodflow/vcookiebar`
keep their own licences (typically MIT + trademark NOTICE).

